          "estimatedMinutes": 210,
          "brief": "Create workshop-seat-request from the supplied semantic and responsive shell. The exact fields are Full name, Student email, one required Morning or Afternoon workshop session, optional Access needs, and required agreement to the fictional attendance terms. Keep visible labels, a fieldset and legend, instructions, native types and constraints, linked error elements, a submit button, and one role=status region. Use novalidate only so the supplied JavaScript can display consistent messages from native ValidityState; do not remove the constraints. On submit, prevent navigation, clear stale errors, test fields in document order, apply the custom trimmed-name length rule, associate text errors, set aria-invalid, focus the first invalid control, and announce success only when every rule passes. Use fictional inputs only and do not save or send them. Break and repair the Student email label association, then complete keyboard, 320-pixel, 200-percent, contrast, and human checks.",
