              "content": "# FreshStart Hub\n\n## Purpose and audience\n## Prerequisites\n## Local preview\n## Features and interaction contract\n## Event data and local saved IDs\n## Failure and recovery behavior\n## Manual acceptance checks\n## GitHub Pages URL\n## Project structure\n## Known limits\n## Human review\n"
