          "stop": "Stop before “Link best practices”; do not convert working local assets to private machine paths or unrelated remote URLs.",
          "note": "Do: Read the path examples through document fragments. Inspect every local link, stylesheet, script, image, fetch URL, and navigation href; remove Windows drive paths and leading-root slashes that would escape the repository subpath.\n\nFinished when: Every internal link and asset uses a deliberate relative path, works on localhost from the project folder, and is ready for a repository subpath.\n\nAccess: Public and free; no account, sign-in, certificate, installation, or payment is required for the assigned portion. A current browser and internet connection are required.\n\nNext: Turn project requirements into a risk-based verification matrix before deployment."
