          "note": "Do: Read the recommended README contents and relative-link guidance. Write purpose, features, local preview steps, test fixtures, live URL, screenshot with useful alt text, tested browsers, known limits, and a statement that human review is still required.\n\nFinished when: A clean checkout can be previewed from the README steps, all README links open, and verified behavior is separated from known limits.\n\nAccess: Public and free to read; the verified GitHub account is required only to commit the README. No paid plan is required.\n\nNext: Run an automated audit as one input to the remaining human checks."
