                "text": "Complete the keyboard route with Tab and Shift+Tab, arrow keys within the radio group, Space on the checkbox, and Enter on submit. Verify visible focus, measured normal-text contrast, 320-pixel reflow, and 200-percent zoom without clipping or horizontal page scrolling."
