            "content": "campus-services-viewer/\n  index.html\n  styles.css\n  app.js\n  data/\n    services.json\n    empty.json\n    malformed.json\n    invalid-shape.json\n  evidence.md\n\nThere is deliberately no data/missing.json.\n"
